        "text": "诶！？你...你好",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "咱叫紫夜白",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "是个夜行生物啦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "还有....",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "angry",
        "text": "你打扰到我睡觉啦！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "playful",
        "text": "不过没关系的啦，咱也应该起床啦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "startled",
        "text": "唔诶！？是僵尸！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "angry",
        "text": "僵尸们都坏坏的，它们总是来打扰我",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "star",
        "text": "既然你来啦，就去帮咱处理下啦～",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:purwhite",
        "portrait": "star",
        "text": "加油哦！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      }
